es Joybird, an omni-channel, direct to consumer retailer and manufacturer of upholstered furniture, as well as sells to the end consumer primarily online through its www.joybird.com website and small-format stores in key markets. The company was formerly known as La-Z-Boy Chair Company and changed its name to La-Z-Boy Incorporated in 1996. La-Z-Boy Incorporated was founded in 1927 and is headquartered in Monroe, Michigan."}}